\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces Entity-Relationship (ER) Architecture of GreenSynth Analytics: Detailed relational model illustrating core tables, primary/foreign key mappings, and cascading integrity constraints.}}{52}{}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.2}{\ignorespaces Executive Dashboard: Overview of active research initiatives, synthesis experiment counts, sample inventories, and recent characterization events.}}{57}{}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.3}{\ignorespaces Experiment and Sample Management Interface: Logging synthesis run parameters, solution concentrations, substrate temperatures, and tracking sample lifecycles.}}{58}{}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.4}{\ignorespaces XRD Diffractogram Analysis View: Interactive diffraction pattern visualization, background subtraction, peak identification, and automated Scherrer crystallite size calculation.}}{59}{}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.5}{\ignorespaces UV-Vis Absorption and Automated Tauc Plot Extraction: Numerical first-derivative inflection search and linear tangent regression for direct optical bandgap ($E_g$) derivation.}}{60}{}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.6}{\ignorespaces Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM) Morphological Module: High-resolution surface imaging, grain boundary contrast adjustment, and automated grain size evaluation.}}{61}{}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.7}{\ignorespaces Machine Learning Regressor Leaderboard: Comparative model evaluation benchmarking Random Forest and XGBoost predictive performance ($R^2$, RMSE, MAE) for material property forecasting.}}{62}{}%
